  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacity for Improving Environmental Compliance and Promoting Cleaner Production in the Industrial Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of this grant is to undertake activities that will seek to build capacity to promote cleaner production, and improve environmental compliance in the industrial sector (particularly in small and medium enterprises) in Uruguay.  Component 1: Reviewing Legal and Regulatory Framework for Strengthening Pollution Management and Environmental Compliance. Component 2: Assessing Institutional Needs for (i) Better Pollution Control, and (ii) Improved Monitoring and Enforcement Component 3: Building Technical Capacity within DINAMA and to Disseminate to the Industrial Sector</narrative>
  </description>
